/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于\n          </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13.3333px;\">\n           Finca San Francisco\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          圣弗朗西斯科农场(Finca San Francisco) 坐落于厄瓜多尔洛哈省的马拉卡托斯山谷 (Malacatos Valley)，占地5公顷，海拔高达1900米。庄园种植品种有卡杜艾、卡杜拉、铁皮卡、波旁、SL34、希爪和瑰夏等；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXicOc8c8QUCfUn3ia5UX5ES298pj0TCnql2sXy9RDMrVGXYfNmeoN96sqpO1VmUUBpsGZkvYB09iaA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Gr457cyFia7RXicOc8c8QUCfUn3ia5UX5ESyyBmeMPL7lA33EnoJaLhUM9blouawFVoTdSMJF4YpwGVORACI6ObiaQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          庄园主赫尔曼·罗密欧·巴乌塔·帕切科（Germán Ramiro Pauta Pacheco）不仅是一位农学家，更是一位对咖啡、可可、花卉和非洲棕榈研究充满热情的学者。他在粮食安全、植物检疫管理和施肥领域积累了深厚的专业知识，将科学与自然的智慧融入庄园的每一寸土地。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXicOc8c8QUCfUn3ia5UX5ESC0CMzV5Ye9FF7AkONak8TicwnQtOr4aTZXWPCAr1bKvzfExZqbicCROg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXicOc8c8QUCfUn3ia5UX5ES7oVztec4srhEXCZiaPv5AIVOUewM6wyUskm2zZL0cN9haeelSpHxoaA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 0em;\">\n          凭借对品质的极致追求与精湛的种植技艺，圣弗朗西斯科庄园屡获地区殊荣，成为该地区最负盛名的咖啡生产商之一。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXicOc8c8QUCfUn3ia5UX5ESzDDhrvvcRpY3ljLWwKp7HuuoXNx2FM5pNlahWoBD1tNCKMlNYxdibdg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 0em;\">\n           庄园获奖经历\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<o:p>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 0em;\">\n            2023 Catación de Café de Oro, Zaruma比赛冠军\n           </span>\n<o:p>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 0em;\">\n            2024 Café de Especialidad Fino Aroma 比赛冠军\n           </span>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);font-size: 10pt;\">\n<o:p>\n</o:p>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
